WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV v3.0 — agency (45s) Narrator Joy

1
00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:03.062
First, an agent must aim at a goal,

2
00:00:03.062 --> 00:00:07.117
act on the world, and stay within an energy budget.

3
00:00:07.557 --> 00:00:10.707
Second, physics prices every decision,

4
00:00:10.707 --> 00:00:17.173
creating one optimal pace between slow idle drain and frantic switching waste.

5
00:00:17.613 --> 00:00:24.946
Third, among systems that finish a task correctly, the smarter one is whichever spent less energy.

6
00:00:25.386 --> 00:00:29.018
Think of driving a car across a desert on one tank

7
00:00:29.018 --> 00:00:33.884
of fuel. Crawl at walking speed and baseline engine idle drains the

8
00:00:33.884 --> 00:00:38.533
tank; floor the pedal and air drag burns fuel before you arrive.

9
00:00:38.973 --> 00:00:42.485
Capability means crossing the finish line at all;

10
00:00:42.485 --> 00:00:51.802
intelligence means how little energy that verified completion took, turning raw AI leaderboards into honest physical measurements.
